{
  "name": "A file tree",
  "kind": "behaviour",
  "topic": "Drag and drop",
  "component": "HottyTree: reorderable, moved, onMove",
  "icon": "folder",
  "description": "A reorderable HottyTree. Drag a file or a folder: over a folder's middle it goes into the folder, which the folder's row in the accent shows, and elsewhere a line shows where it would land; a folder never goes into itself or anything in it. A folder with nothing in it yet has children: []. Alt+ArrowUp and Alt+ArrowDown move the selected node among its siblings, Alt+ArrowLeft out of its folder, and Alt+ArrowRight into the folder above it. Each move writes the tree to /files and the move to /moved, then sends moved with it.",
